#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<getusershell()> function returns the next line from the file I</etc/"
#| "shells>, opening the file if necessary.  The line should contain the "
#| "pathname of a valid user shell.  If I</etc/shells> does not exist or is "
#| "unreadable, B<getusershell()> behaves as if I</bin/sh> and I</bin/csh> "
#| "were listed in the file."
msgid ""
"The B<getusershell>()  function returns the next line from the file I</etc/"
"shells>, opening the file if necessary.  The line should contain the "
"pathname of a valid user shell.  If I</etc/shells> does not exist or is "
"unreadable, B<getusershell>()  behaves as if I</bin/sh> and I</bin/csh> were "
"listed in the file."
msgstr ""
"A função B<getusershell()> retorna a próxima linha do arquivo I</etc/"
"shells>, abrindo-o se necessário. A linha deve conter o caminho de um shell "
"válido de usuário. Se I</etc/shells> não existe ou não é legível, "
"B<getusershell()> comporta-se como se I</bin/sh> e I</bin/csh> estivessem "
"listados no arquivo."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The B<setusershell()> function rewinds I</etc/shells>."
msgid "The B<setusershell>()  function rewinds I</etc/shells>."
msgstr ""
"A função B<setusershell()> retrocede o ponteiro do arquivo I</etc/shells> "
"para o início."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The B<endusershell()> function closes I</etc/shells>."
